{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/banner_with_text.png?t=1743112852\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bearzerk is a twisted teddy world where you harness bizarre plush powers, gather an arsenal of wacky weapons, and crush wave after wave of stitched nightmares. Survive 25 grueling rounds\u2014every 5th wave brings a warped boss\u2014and face off against the dreaded Seamstress at the end. Choose from 15 unique plush warriors, each with their own monstrous quirks and synergy potential. It\u2019s an auto-shooter that focuses on creative builds, combos, and endless plush pandemonium. <br>  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/double_banner.png?t=1743112852\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features (Early Access)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15 Playable Characters</strong>: From raging ragdolls to warped wizards, each bears unique traits for outlandish playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 Weapons &amp; 40+ Armor Items/Perks</strong>: Patch together insane combos with bizarre buffs and lethal fluff-laced armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wave-Based Madness</strong>: Survive 25 intense rounds. Boss encounters spawn every 5 waves, culminating in a showdown with the horrific Seamstress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Feeling overstuffed? Dive into endless rounds and see how long your plush can stand the fury.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Building Runs</strong>: Customize your teddy\u2019s loadout each run, layering synergy-rich upgrades to mow down enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scroll of Stitches (Meta Unlocks)</strong>: Earn permanent power boosts by leveling up your plush prowess, ensuring each new run feels bigger and badder than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Future Content</strong>: New maps, playable characters, mini-bosses, and more plush-pounding encounters planned throughout Early Access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/mega_doug_transparent.png?t=1743112852\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Bearzerk arrives in Early Access soon\u2014brace yourself for a realm where cute meets chaotic, and every patchwork hero is just a stitch away from total mayhem. We will be adding content just about as fast as we can - jump in and get your fluff stuffed.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545290?t=1743112852","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545290?t=1743112852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/052338c726d5aa0c98f446f99d8307b4aa934d17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743112852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/052338c726d5aa0c98f446f99d8307b4aa934d17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743112852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/banner_with_text.png?t=1743112852\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bearzerk is a twisted teddy world where you harness bizarre plush powers, gather an arsenal of wacky weapons, and crush wave after wave of stitched nightmares. Survive 25 grueling rounds\u2014every 5th wave brings a warped boss\u2014and face off against the dreaded Seamstress at the end. Choose from 15 unique plush warriors, each with their own monstrous quirks and synergy potential. It\u2019s an auto-shooter that focuses on creative builds, combos, and endless plush pandemonium. <br>  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/double_banner.png?t=1743112852\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features (Early Access)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15 Playable Characters</strong>: From raging ragdolls to warped wizards, each bears unique traits for outlandish playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 Weapons &amp; 40+ Armor Items/Perks</strong>: Patch together insane combos with bizarre buffs and lethal fluff-laced armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wave-Based Madness</strong>: Survive 25 intense rounds. Boss encounters spawn every 5 waves, culminating in a showdown with the horrific Seamstress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Feeling overstuffed? Dive into endless rounds and see how long your plush can stand the fury.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Building Runs</strong>: Customize your teddy\u2019s loadout each run, layering synergy-rich upgrades to mow down enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scroll of Stitches (Meta Unlocks)</strong>: Earn permanent power boosts by leveling up your plush prowess, ensuring each new run feels bigger and badder than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Future Content</strong>: New maps, playable characters, mini-bosses, and more plush-pounding encounters planned throughout Early Access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/mega_doug_transparent.png?t=1743112852\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Bearzerk arrives in Early Access soon\u2014brace yourself for a realm where cute meets chaotic, and every patchwork hero is just a stitch away from total mayhem. We will be adding content just about as fast as we can - jump in and get your fluff stuffed.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Dadbod Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/07b65dcc3ed53a36f950fab5f0ed1faec6fa3156/header.jpg?t=1743112852","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 3+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU: 8 RDNA 2 CU'<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Certain menu items are somewhat over response when using a controller. This wil be fixed durng early access development.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 eller Intel Core M</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117797,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117797/movie480.mp4?t=1743112849","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117797/movie_max.mp4?t=1743112849"},"name":"Bearzerk - early access gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117797/830edda25fcd423dda9079e6cc10953cce4ec62d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743112849","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117797/movie480_vp